## Input

```css
@media (min-width: tokens.$tablet) { .a { color: red; } }
@media (tokens.$tablet <= width) { .b { color: red; } }
@media (30rem < width <= tokens.$tablet) { .c { color: red; } }
@media (min-width: (tokens.$tablet)) { .d { color: red; } }
.after { color: blue; }

